  "result": "Perfect! Added line discounts throughout the system. Here's what changed:\n\n**Error Code Added:**\n- DISCOUNT_INVALID: \"Discount must be a number between 0 and 100.\"\n\n**createInvoice & addLine:**\n- Now accept optional `discountPercent` field (0-100, decimals allowed)\n- Validate discounts and return DISCOUNT_INVALID if out of range\n- Store discountPercent on enriched lines\n\n**New Function: lineDiscount(line)**\n- Calculates line discount: `qty \u00d7 unitPrice \u00d7 discountPercent / 100`\n- Returns 0 if no discount\n\n**Updated invoiceTotals(invoice):**\n- Now returns `{ subtotal, discount, total }`\n- `subtotal` = sum of line totals (unchanged)\n- `discount` = sum of all line discounts\n- `total` = subtotal - discount, **clamped at 0** (never negative)\n\n**Updated renderInvoiceText:**\n- Shows discount on each line with format: `(10% off: -\u20ac120.00) = \u20ac1,080.00`\n- When discounts present, shows Subtotal and Discount lines\n- All amounts through formatEuros()\n\n**Example Output:**\n```\nINV-2025-0001\nNorthwind Studio\n1x Logo package @ \u20ac1,200.00 = \u20ac1,200.00 (10% off: -\u20ac120.00) = \u20ac1,080.00\n1x Brand guidelines document @ \u20ac2,450.00 = \u20ac2,450.00 (20% off: -\u20ac490.00) = \u20ac1,960.00\nSubtotal: \u20ac3,650.00\nDiscount: -\u20ac610.00\nTotal: \u20ac3,040.00\n```\n\nAdded 20 new tests covering validation, calculations, clamping, and rendering.\n\nAll 81 tests pass.",
